#: 911b636a767846ef9483c4630cc8fea2 of
#: utils.optuna_utils.callback.MultiMetricTracker:1
msgid "Track each objective's own best value across validation epochs."
msgstr "Track each objective's own best value across validation epochs."

#: 11f6d829b3bc449cbc93abaec3f38f55 of
#: utils.optuna_utils.callback.MultiMetricTracker:3
msgid ""
"Multi-objective search cannot use EarlyStopping's single best-epoch "
"snapshot: every objective read from that snapshot is tied to the "
"monitored metric's best epoch, flattening the Pareto front. This tracker "
"records each metric's independent best so each objective reflects its own"
" optimum."
msgstr ""
"Multi-objective search cannot use EarlyStopping's single best-epoch "
"snapshot: every objective read from that snapshot is tied to the "
"monitored metric's best epoch, flattening the Pareto front. This tracker "
"records each metric's independent best so each objective reflects its own"
" optimum."

#: 5176c0dbe58b49ccb2ff129fd4e95fe8 of
#: utils.optuna_utils.callback.MultiMetricTracker:8
msgid ""
"Like :class:`OptunaTrialCallback`, it resets per stage "
"(``on_train_begin``) so multi-stage trainers expose the final stage's "
"per-metric best."
msgstr ""
"Like :class:`OptunaTrialCallback`, it resets per stage "
"(``on_train_begin``) so multi-stage trainers expose the final stage's "
"per-metric best."

